hi in this video I would talk about how  to trace a cell secretory pathway so we  know that four cell proteins are  produced in the endoplasmic reticulum on  the ribosomes and then they are packaged  into the Golgi and from Golgi they move  to the membrane if it's a membrane-bound  protein then it would be membrane it  would be in the membrane bound condition  and if it's a secretory protein then it  would be secreted outside of the cell  now the question is how to prove that  that this is the secretory pathway of  the cell and the secretory pathway of  the cell includes ER Golgi and then to  the plasma membrane in order to do so we  can perform one experiment so we know  that vsvg  which is actually vesicular stomatitis  virus glycoprotein which is a membrane  protein so it's actually displayed on  the membrane in case of virus infected  cells so what we can do we can take  those gene sequence for vsvg and we can  tag it with the n-terminal gfp and we  can clone the whole thing in mammalian  expression vector then we can transfect  it into a mammalian cell culture after  transfecting it into the mammalian cell  culture what would happen the V is VG  containing expression vector would be  expressing into the nucleus and inside  the nucleus from this expression vector  mRNA would be produced and that mRNA  would go outside the nucleus and it  would go to the ER there the translation  would happen on the ribosomes and it  would follow the cell secretory path now  if it is following the cell secretory  path like ER then kool g then plasma  membrane then over time if we record it  in a live cell imaging that we would  find that  in several timeframe several component  of the cells are labeled so for instance  initially year would be leveled then we  would expect Galli would be labeled and  at the end plasma membrane would be  leveled so several researchers did same  kind of experiment and found that in the  0 minute you can see the ER which is  around nucleus is labeled and then at 40  minutes time after starting the  recording you can see the Golgi is  actually marked by GFP that means after  40 minutes the whole protein is actually  moving to Golgi and actually lighting up  the Golgi and if we with hundred minutes  then what would happen these whole  plasma membrane of the cell would be  actually eliminated so that also  suggests that our cell secretory pathway  is from ER to Golgi to plasma membrane  so that concludes the video on the  tracing of cell secretory pathway if you  liked my video give me the quick thumbs  up and don't forget to subscribe and  please leave your comment below thank  you
 

